{"id": "folsom-stormwater-construction-rebid", "title": "One high bid sent the Folsom flood project back to market", "seconds": 65.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "2ca05d13e48835e6", "words": 187, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In San Francisco’s Inner Mission, a sewer project is supposed to keep wastewater off the streets.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.26, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["When", "sewers", "overflow"], "sub": "The flood-protection deadline"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.39, 0.99, 1.24, 1.94, 2.09, 2.4, 2.87, 3.0, 3.36, 3.45, 3.69, 4.22, 4.39, 4.51]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The regional water board set a June 2027 deadline to certify the project in service.", "t0": 5.38, "t1": 11.22, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "The flood-protection deadline", "text": "June 30, 2027", "mark": "June"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 0.83, 1.11, 1.33, 1.47, 2.09, 2.5, 3.18, 3.91, 4.14, 4.59, 4.72, 5.18, 5.32]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2023, the utility estimated that construction would cost $282 million.", "t0": 11.44, "t1": 16.85, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$282 million", "label": "Design met buried freeway supports"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.48, 1.26, 1.44, 1.93, 2.4, 2.56, 3.08, 3.24, 3.53, 3.77, 4.09, 4.52, 4.87]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Its engineers discovered buried freeway supports where they planned to put the tunnel.", "t0": 16.97, "t1": 21.15, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Buried freeway supports"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.69, 1.15, 1.5, 1.9, 2.39, 2.59, 2.74, 3.07, 3.16, 3.37, 3.47]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Crews finished the smaller upstream sewer pipes in 2025.", "t0": 21.27, "t1": 24.78, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Smaller pipes completed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.72, 0.84, 1.23, 1.72, 2.01, 2.32, 2.45, 2.74]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state offered up to $5 million in principal forgiveness, conditional on performance.", "t0": 24.9, "t1": 29.73, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5 million", "label": "An upstream sewer opened first"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.5, 0.77, 0.87, 1.0, 1.3, 1.6, 1.94, 2.06, 2.48, 3.37, 3.97, 4.13]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In March 2026, three firms qualified to bid on the box sewers. Only one submitted a price.", "t0": 29.85, "t1": 36.2, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "1 bid", "label": "One bid for the box sewers"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.56, 0.84, 1.63, 1.93, 2.28, 2.81, 2.92, 3.11, 3.21, 3.31, 3.59, 4.82, 5.13, 5.39, 5.8, 5.87]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The utility called that bid high and prepared to seek new bids.", "t0": 36.32, "t1": 39.69, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "One high bid"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.64, 0.9, 1.1, 1.4, 1.8, 1.95, 2.32, 2.43, 2.69, 2.87]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "By June 2026, the construction forecast was $402.5 million.", "t0": 39.81, "t1": 45.66, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$402.5 million", "label": "One bid for the box sewers"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.59, 0.93, 1.54, 1.66, 2.2, 2.73, 2.92, 3.21, 3.51, 3.72, 3.98, 4.32, 4.72]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "That figure still excluded the potential effect of the high bid.", "t0": 45.66, "t1": 48.85, "shot": "s8b", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The forecast excluded the high bid"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.31, 0.63, 0.86, 1.38, 1.48, 1.92, 2.28, 2.38, 2.5, 2.7]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "In November 2026, the City authorized up to $1,454,926 for tunnel easements.", "t0": 49.07, "t1": 55.09, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,454,926", "label": "Bryant Street easements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.57, 0.83, 1.48, 1.65, 1.96, 2.45, 2.61, 2.72, 2.99, 3.23, 3.5, 3.78, 4.09, 4.46, 4.62, 4.94]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The utility now lists 2030 for completion.", "t0": 55.09, "t1": 57.85, "shot": "s9b", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2030", "label": "Projected completion"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.91, 1.19, 1.43, 1.75, 2.07, 2.21]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "A written decision from the regulator would show whether the deadline changed.", "t0": 57.97, "t1": 61.84, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The regulator’s written decision"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 0.82, 0.99, 1.1, 1.59, 1.8, 2.14, 2.44, 2.55, 3.02]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 61.96, "t1": 64.33, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The flood-protection deadline", "b": "Design met buried freeway supports", "o": "The tunnel still needed land rights"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "document"}